cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this repository, please cite it as below.
title: "Trustworthy AI Standardisation for Financial Services"
abstract: >-
  Technical analysis and implementation guidance for trustworthy AI
  standardisation in financial services, produced under the StandICT.eu 2029
  Fellowship. Covers a cross-standard assessment of ISO/IEC 42001, ISO/IEC
  23894, ISO/IEC 5338 and ISO/IEC TS 25570, a financial-AI controls gap matrix,
  a reliability gap analysis for adaptive and agentic system forms, and the
  Continuous Reliability Assurance (CRA) proposal with a reference
  implementation.
type: software
